00:11:28.919 --> 00:11:29.752
- Huh?

00:11:29.752 --> 00:11:31.322
- What's it time to? What are we doing?

00:11:31.322 --> 00:11:32.647
- Wands!

00:11:32.647 --> 00:11:35.238
- Buy some magic wands.

00:11:35.238 --> 00:11:36.253
Let's go.

00:11:36.253 --> 00:11:39.280
So, every year we have this
policy that the kids get

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:42.359
to pick one thing as a present
and they have to like it

00:11:42.359 --> 00:11:44.875
and not ask every time we go in the store.

00:11:44.875 --> 00:11:47.584
And they all decided, in
advance, that they wanted to buy

00:11:47.584 --> 00:11:51.519
a magic wand at the Ollivanders Wand Shop.

00:11:51.519 --> 00:11:54.612
So, we saved it for the last day

00:11:54.612 --> 00:11:56.262
and we're about to go buy them right now.

00:11:56.262 --> 00:11:57.846
I think it's like 50 bucks a wand

00:11:57.846 --> 00:11:59.689
or something but it's all good.

00:11:59.689 --> 00:12:00.963
Let's do it. It's for the kids.

00:12:00.963 --> 00:12:03.796
(classical music)

00:12:05.355 --> 00:12:07.272
Time to buy some wands.

00:12:16.254 --> 00:12:17.421
Who's is that?

00:12:18.337 --> 00:12:20.429
- Death Eater's but it
doesn't say which Death Eater.

00:12:20.429 --> 00:12:21.989
- Isn't this the gold label?

00:12:21.989 --> 00:12:23.416
- Yeah. I think so.

00:12:23.416 --> 00:12:25.315
You got a Death Eater's wand?

00:12:25.315 --> 00:12:26.148
- Yeah.

00:12:26.148 --> 00:12:29.380
- That's what you wanted? Are you happy?

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:30.213
All right.

00:12:39.183 --> 00:12:42.218
- I got the map so I'll put it in my bag.

00:12:42.218 --> 00:12:43.344
I got the map.

00:12:43.344 --> 00:12:45.761
- Let's see you cast a spell.

00:12:47.584 --> 00:12:48.417
Whoa!

00:12:52.883 --> 00:12:54.285
- Oh, I did it again!

00:12:54.285 --> 00:12:56.533
- How's the wife doing?

00:12:56.533 --> 00:12:57.866
You okay? Tired?

00:12:58.841 --> 00:12:59.674
- Kind of.

00:12:59.674 --> 00:13:00.507
- Wants some caffeine?

00:13:00.507 --> 00:13:01.340
- No.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:02.704
- No? Want some water?

00:13:02.704 --> 00:13:03.537
- Maybe.

00:13:03.537 --> 00:13:05.732
- Oh, you want water? We'll get water.

00:13:05.732 --> 00:13:07.565
We're going to be leaving

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:10.899
this side of Universal Studios,

00:13:10.899 --> 00:13:14.794
hopping on Hogwarts Express
and going to London,

00:13:14.794 --> 00:13:15.890
the other side.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:18.723
(classical music)

00:13:21.699 --> 00:13:23.815
All right, once again,
not allowed to film.

00:13:23.815 --> 00:13:25.873
Good job, Universal Studios.

00:13:25.873 --> 00:13:30.040
But we made it into London and
we're going to have more fun.

00:13:31.461 --> 00:13:33.961
(light music)

00:13:36.624 --> 00:13:39.207
Ready? Through the wall, ready?

00:13:42.611 --> 00:13:43.694
Diagon Alley.

00:13:45.195 --> 00:13:46.028
- Oh my.

00:13:47.839 --> 00:13:49.794
This is seriously unreal.

00:13:49.794 --> 00:13:51.286
- Pretty unreal?

00:13:51.286 --> 00:13:53.786
(light music)

00:13:58.979 --> 00:14:02.325
We're going to lose our bags
again. No filming again.

00:14:02.325 --> 00:14:05.086
It's quite an experience, but no filming.

00:14:05.086 --> 00:14:07.608
Takes a little bit out of it.
I want to share with you guys.

00:14:07.608 --> 00:14:09.473
But we'll go have some fun, at least.

00:14:09.473 --> 00:14:12.451
Well, another really fun ride.
Universal does a good job.

00:14:12.451 --> 00:14:13.284
- Yeah.

00:14:13.284 --> 00:14:14.680
- Nina screamed the whole time

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:15.620
and almost fell out of her chair.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.861
- How do you know?

00:14:16.861 --> 00:14:18.965
- Because you were behind me.

00:14:18.965 --> 00:14:20.947
I can't hear you on this side anymore.

00:14:20.947 --> 00:14:21.780
- Yeah.

00:14:23.376 --> 00:14:24.934
- Was it fun?

00:14:24.934 --> 00:14:25.812
- Yes.

00:14:25.812 --> 00:14:28.269
- Yeah? All right. Good.

00:14:28.269 --> 00:14:30.395
Let's keep it moving. More rides to come.

00:14:30.395 --> 00:14:33.145
(cheerful music)

00:14:45.028 --> 00:14:47.149
Next up, Men in Black.

00:14:47.149 --> 00:14:49.773
- What's Men in Black?

00:14:49.773 --> 00:14:53.385
- It's a ride. The Men in Black ride.

00:14:53.385 --> 00:14:54.218
Let's do it.

00:14:54.218 --> 00:14:57.552
(upbeat music)

00:14:57.552 --> 00:15:00.719
Hey-hey! Guess what? No cameras again.

00:15:01.717 --> 00:15:04.342
Yeah, Universal Studios.

00:15:04.342 --> 00:15:07.218
So, to go on the ride,
you got to put your stuff

00:15:07.218 --> 00:15:11.237
in these lockers so you
got to squish everything in

00:15:11.237 --> 00:15:16.161
and then there's massive
line-ups to get your stuff back.

00:15:16.161 --> 00:15:18.828
Which is a big pain in the butt.

00:15:20.529 --> 00:15:22.039
So, I think when we come back,

00:15:22.039 --> 00:15:25.872
we either don't bring
bags or don't come back.

00:15:26.904 --> 00:15:29.815
Universal, dude, you
got to do a better job.

00:15:29.815 --> 00:15:32.697
(upbeat music)

00:15:32.697 --> 00:15:35.530
Next ride up is The Simpsons ride.

00:15:36.647 --> 00:15:37.480
- Yay!

00:15:39.047 --> 00:15:40.380
- Simpsons ride.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:51.853
- What'd you think?

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:53.873
Thumbs up?

00:15:56.463 --> 00:15:58.033
I'm nauseous.

00:15:58.033 --> 00:15:58.899
- You're nauseous?

00:15:58.899 --> 00:15:59.732
- How you doing?

00:15:59.732 --> 00:16:00.565
- I'm good.

00:16:00.565 --> 00:16:02.348
- You're okay? How you guys doing?

00:16:02.348 --> 00:16:03.181
- Fun.

00:16:05.074 --> 00:16:06.998
- Nauseous. Simulation rides.

00:16:06.998 --> 00:16:08.693
- What ride are we going on next?

00:16:08.693 --> 00:16:10.065
- I don't know. We'll see.

00:16:10.065 --> 00:16:12.732
(uptempo music)

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.069
All right, kids. Next
up, The Minions ride!

00:16:19.069 --> 00:16:20.700
(cheers)

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.327
Let's see some minions.

00:16:22.327 --> 00:16:24.037
I married a minion.

00:16:24.037 --> 00:16:25.564
- I'm not a minion.

00:16:25.564 --> 00:16:27.383
I'm not that yellow.

00:16:27.383 --> 00:16:28.673
- She likes banana.

00:16:28.673 --> 00:16:30.300
- I do like banana.

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.122
- Nina, what did you
have for breakfast today?

00:16:32.122 --> 00:16:33.289
- Two bananas.

00:16:34.986 --> 00:16:36.986
See! I married a minion.

00:16:44.052 --> 00:16:46.962
All right, so it's
another motion simulator.

00:16:46.962 --> 00:16:49.478
The last one made me nauseous so
I'm going to sit this one out.

00:16:49.478 --> 00:16:52.207
Let the kids and Nina have fun

00:16:52.207 --> 00:16:56.164
and just take in some
sun, in beautiful Florida.

00:16:56.164 --> 00:16:58.914
(cheerful music)

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:04.994
How was it?

00:17:04.994 --> 00:17:05.827
- Awesome!

00:17:05.827 --> 00:17:06.668
- It was awesome.

00:17:06.668 --> 00:17:07.658
- Was it good?

00:17:07.658 --> 00:17:08.491
- Yeah, it was.

00:17:08.491 --> 00:17:09.324
- You enjoyed?

00:17:09.324 --> 00:17:10.157
- Yes.

00:17:10.157 --> 00:17:11.613
- Would I have enjoyed? Probably not.

00:17:11.613 --> 00:17:14.008
- No, it's not that bad, actually.

00:17:14.008 --> 00:17:16.065
- Last thing of the day, then we go home.

00:17:16.065 --> 00:17:18.156
We're going to get ice
cream, then we go home.

00:17:18.156 --> 00:17:19.156
Shrek in 4D!

00:17:20.328 --> 00:17:21.161
You ready?

00:17:22.995 --> 00:17:25.609
The excitement is unreal.

00:17:25.609 --> 00:17:27.359
Shrek 4D. Here we go.

00:17:31.429 --> 00:17:32.262
- Daddy!

00:17:32.262 --> 00:17:33.644
- How was it?

00:17:33.644 --> 00:17:34.484
- Good!

00:17:34.484 --> 00:17:35.317
- Good?

00:17:35.317 --> 00:17:36.782
- Time for ice cream!

00:17:36.782 --> 00:17:37.782
- Ice cream.

00:17:38.661 --> 00:17:39.494
Ice cream.

00:17:40.409 --> 00:17:41.242
Ice cream.

00:17:42.469 --> 00:17:44.886
(warm music)

00:17:54.885 --> 00:17:57.680
All right, kids are having ice
cream. Nina got a huge one.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.014
How's the ice cream, kids?

00:17:59.014 --> 00:18:00.324
- It's good.

00:18:00.324 --> 00:18:02.240
- I have little bits of cotton candy.

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:04.504
- You got cotton candy? It's yummy.

00:18:04.504 --> 00:18:05.363
- Me too.

00:18:05.363 --> 00:18:07.114
- He got cotton candy.

00:18:07.114 --> 00:18:11.419
- Stephanie got Milk and Cookies, I think.

00:18:11.419 --> 00:18:14.849
Nina got the ginormous Chocolate Chunk.

00:18:14.849 --> 00:18:18.187
- Triple Caramel Chocolate Chunk.

00:18:18.187 --> 00:18:20.770
- And there's mine. Milk shake.

00:18:25.248 --> 00:18:26.164
- Is it good?

00:18:26.164 --> 00:18:28.458
- Mm-hmm. Chocolatey. Want to try it?

00:18:28.458 --> 00:18:29.291
- Yeah.

00:18:33.801 --> 00:18:35.634
Yeah, very chocolatey.

00:18:36.999 --> 00:18:38.579
- All right, that's it for us today.

00:18:38.579 --> 00:18:40.382
Thank you, guys, for joining
us. Hope you enjoyed.

00:18:40.382 --> 00:18:41.592
You guys have fun?

00:18:41.592 --> 00:18:42.425
- Yes!

00:18:42.425 --> 00:18:44.361
- Favorite ride of the day?

00:18:44.361 --> 00:18:45.266
- Minions.

00:18:45.266 --> 00:18:47.932
- Minions? Wow! More than
the Harry Potter stuff.

00:18:47.932 --> 00:18:49.554
- Oh, Harry Potter!

00:18:49.554 --> 00:18:51.741
- The wand! The wand thing.

00:18:51.741 --> 00:18:52.826
- The wand. Nina?

00:18:52.826 --> 00:18:53.659
- The wand!

00:18:53.659 --> 00:18:54.492
- Ice cream.

00:18:54.492 --> 00:18:55.909
- Ice cream. Wow!

00:18:57.037 --> 00:18:58.584
Next time, we'll just get
you ice cream, you stay home.

00:18:58.584 --> 00:19:01.569
There's Ben &amp; Jerry's everywhere.

00:19:01.569 --> 00:19:03.366
Thank you, guys, for watching!

00:19:03.366 --> 00:19:05.033
Continue to believe!

00:19:06.809 --> 00:19:10.976
- We'll see you soon.
Whatever you want, we're in.

00:19:11.867 --> 00:19:12.867
- Bye, guys.

00:19:14.131 --> 00:19:16.063
Nina can do whatever she wants because?

00:19:16.063 --> 00:19:17.687
- I'm Nina.

00:19:17.687 --> 00:19:20.917
- She's Nina Carmichael.
That's how we roll.

00:19:20.917 --> 00:19:23.223
(whooshing air)

